## Branch Conflict Check — Required Before Starting Any Branch

Before creating a new branch, every agent must:

1. Read `docs/ACTIVE_BRANCHES.md` — scan the "Files owned" column for overlap with files you plan to touch
2. Cross-reference open PRs: `gh pr list --repo cp-build-dev-ops/command-center-reboot --state open --json headRefName,title`
3. If any active branch or open PR owns files you plan to touch, **surface the conflict to your user before proceeding**:

```
⚠️ Conflict: feat/other-branch (owner: Hannah) is currently touching components/tour/TourPlayer.tsx.
Your work also needs that file. Options:
  A) Wait for feat/other-branch to merge first
  B) Coordinate with Hannah to split the changes
  C) Proceed anyway — I'll document the overlap in ACTIVE_BRANCHES.md
Which do you prefer?
```

Never silently edit a file another active branch owns. Always get a decision first.

