### GitHub Actions Permissions

The `cp-build-dev-ops` organization has **read/write workflow permissions** and **"Allow GitHub Actions to create and approve pull requests"** enabled at the org level. Individual workflow files declare their own `permissions:` blocks. Workflows do not require manual approval to run.

## Direct Pushes to `main` Are Blocked

All changes go through `dev` via PR. `main` is protected and requires passing CI + approval.
